{"ref":"character:perkeo","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Jimbo.gif","w":40,"h":42}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ante Chamber)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Perkeo is a playable character from the Ante Chamber DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Booster.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:celestial-booster"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Booster","r":"weapon:celestial-booster"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["LEM_PERKEO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["LEM_CharacterController_002"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Booster.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:celestial-booster"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Booster","r":"weapon:celestial-booster"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the Gros Michel."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ante_Chamber_-_Balatro_Main_Theme.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Ante Chamber - Balatro Main Theme\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["120"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+7"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Perkeo can be unlocked by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Gros_Michel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gros-michel"}," ",{"t":"Gros Michel","r":"weapon:gros-michel"}," into the ",{"i":"Sprite-Cavendish.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cavendish"}," ",{"t":"Cavendish","r":"weapon:cavendish"},", with a max level ",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"t":"Outer Saboteur","r":"passive:outer-saboteur"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Perkeo can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"doublenegative\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Perkeo starts with +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", and +7 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Perkeo is able to find ",{"i":"Sprite-Survarocchi.png","w":24,"h":24}," Survarots from Light Sources."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Notably, Perkeo does not start with a draft, unlike ",{"i":"Sprite-Jimbo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:jimbo"}," ",{"t":"Jimbo","r":"character:jimbo"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Chicot.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:chicot"}," ",{"t":"Chicot","r":"character:chicot"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Secretino_Dagsson.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," ",{"t":"Secretino Dagsson","r":"character:secretino-dagsson"},"."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Perkeo also has 100 slots for Passive Weapons. This allows him to carry every Passive Weapon in the game without issue."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Perkeo.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Character sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Perkeo.gif","w":103,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His spell \"doublenegative\" is a reference to his joker effect in ",{"t":"Balatro","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balatro"},", where he creates a ",{"t":"Negative","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Negative"}," copy of a random ",{"t":"consumable","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Consumable"}," that is currently in the player's possession. The word \"double\" implies the copying of a Consumable and the word \"negative\" implies that the copy has a Negative edition. This is also the basis for his 100 passive slots, as Negative cards in Balatro give an additional slot to whatever zone the Negative card is in, effectively gaining additional slots."]},{"c":["Prior to v1.15, either using this character, entering the ",{"t":"Ante Chamber stage","r":"stage:ante-chamber-stage"},", using ",{"i":"Sprite-Secretino_Dagsson.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," ",{"t":"Secretino Dagsson","r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," or any of the other Ante Chamber characters would allow for the usage of Survarots. With the introduction of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Survarocchi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:survarocchi"}," ",{"t":"Survarocchi","r":"relic:survarocchi"},", this is no longer the case."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Perkeo","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Perkeo"}," on the ",{"t":"Balatro Wiki","x":"https://balatrowiki.org"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}